    "detailed_description": "<strong>Thesmophoria</strong> is a third person shooter where you immerse yourself into Ancient Greece. Team up &amp; battle against each other in multiple game modes. <br><br><strong>Conquest</strong>- Control the objectives to earn points over time, the more objectives you control the faster your team gain points. <br><strong>Rush</strong>- Destroy or defend the objectives, if the attacker team runs out of reinforcements the defender team wins.<br><strong>Kill Confirmed</strong>- Kill players of the opposing team and collect the dogtags to earn points, you can also collect dogtags from your team to deny the points for the other enemy team.<br><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>- Kill the enemy players to gain points.<br><strong>Free For All</strong>- Kill every other player to gain points.<br><strong>Capture The Flag</strong>- Capture the enemy flag and bring it to your own base to make points, if the enemy team has your flag you will have to retrieve it first.<br><br>Play single player with bots or multiplayer with humans. <br>Either way, Don't disappoint the Gods....",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Thesmophoria</strong> is a third person shooter where you immerse yourself into Ancient Greece. Team up &amp; battle against each other in multiple game modes. <br><br><strong>Conquest</strong>- Control the objectives to earn points over time, the more objectives you control the faster your team gain points. <br><strong>Rush</strong>- Destroy or defend the objectives, if the attacker team runs out of reinforcements the defender team wins.<br><strong>Kill Confirmed</strong>- Kill players of the opposing team and collect the dogtags to earn points, you can also collect dogtags from your team to deny the points for the other enemy team.<br><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>- Kill the enemy players to gain points.<br><strong>Free For All</strong>- Kill every other player to gain points.<br><strong>Capture The Flag</strong>- Capture the enemy flag and bring it to your own base to make points, if the enemy team has your flag you will have to retrieve it first.<br><br>Play single player with bots or multiplayer with humans. <br>Either way, Don't disappoint the Gods....",
    "short_description": "Do you and your friends have what it takes to impress the Greek Gods?",
